OL,3,GNEWSAPT's shopping centre sprint in    
OL,4,Amemory of friend                       
OL,6,FA personal trainer has organised a run 
OL,7,Faround an empty shopping centre in     
OL,8,Fmemory of his friend who died by       
OL,9,Fsuicide.                               
OL,11,FAlex Graham, 24, led a group of runners
OL,12,Fon the 5k (3.1-mile) route through     
OL,13,FGateshead's Metrocentre for his friend 
OL,14,FBen Goodman, who took his own life this
OL,15,Fsummer.                                
OL,17,FThe money raised by the event will be  
OL,18,Fdonated to the North East suicide      
OL,19,Fcharity If U Care Share.               
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
