OL,3,GNEWSAPT's shopping centre sprint in    
OL,4,Amemory of friend                       
OL,6,FGraham said: "It's been tough, but     
OL,7,Fraising money for the charity that's   
OL,8,Fhelping his family grieve and get      
OL,9,Fthrough this process means the absolute
OL,10,Fworld to me."                          
